Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got it. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加里快急疯了，觉得我们没法超越上一季。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gary is freaking out that we can't top last season.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.89,0:08:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那他想让我们怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what does he want us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每集都杀个人吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kill someone every episode?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:49.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，你什么时候能到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm, when are you gonna be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我大概一小时后回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be back in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，罗密欧，你朋友来了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, Romeo, your friends are here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:55.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是我但愿别出现在这儿的那群朋友，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the friends that I was hoping were not gonna show up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:56.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们还是来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they've showed up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能带他们去餐食区\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you please take them to craft service
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.21,0:08:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让他们挡我的路？谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and get them out of my way? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.34,0:09:06.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你干脆直接告诉我怎么回事吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you just tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.21,0:09:09.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是，我现在本该在卡波\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's just, I'm supposed to be in Cabo right now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}享受休赛期的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}enjoying my off-season.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.05,0:09:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，卡波是不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, Cabo's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.85,0:09:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但卡波可解决不了你的公关危机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Cabo is not gonna get you out of your P.R. problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:17.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我没叫那个女人贱人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I didn't call that woman a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:18.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也觉得你没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.63,0:09:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她是想激你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think that she tried to bait you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:21.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，怎么回事……她走过来跟你说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, what did... she came over and talked to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多久来着？你下场后大概19分钟？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was it? Like 19 minutes after you got off the field?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:26.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。对吧，他们想让你在场上像个野兽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Exactly. Right, they want you to be a monster on the field
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后19分钟后变成什么唱诗班乖男孩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then turn into some, like, choir boy 19 minutes later?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，那根本不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.87,0:09:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}肾上腺素那么高，谁都会失控。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With all that adrenaline, anybody would've snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是“谁”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:36.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:39.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是队里第一个黑人四分卫。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the first black quarterback on your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在还是第一个黑人男嘉宾。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're also now the first black suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很多双眼睛盯着你。我懂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a lot of eyes on you. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:49.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你妈怎么说？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What'd your mom say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:55.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉，我妈可高兴不起来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whew, my mom was not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:57.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，她从小教育我要始终明白\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, she raised me to always know
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}规则对我来说会不一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that the rules were gonna be different for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能穿着连帽衫走在街上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Couldn't walk down the street with my hoodie on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不想让人产生误会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Didn't want people to get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:07.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直挺……挺守规矩的，懂吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kept my nose pretty... Pretty clean, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:08.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}形象……毫无污点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Image... squeaky clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:11.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不碰毒品，没有闹剧，没有孩子妈，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No drugs, no drama, no baby mamas,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:14.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果我却干了这种蠢事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then I go and do something stupid like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:16.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，听着。这是一次性的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, listen. This is a one-time thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不能定义你是什么人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This does not make you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:22.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话…… 嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we're being honest... Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大多数时候我感觉像……一头笼中狮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mostly I feel like a... a caged lion
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一半时间都勉强压着脾气。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and barely keeping a lid on it half the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，你正在跟一个人说话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you're talking to somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.43,0:10:31.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她真的上电视告诉全世界\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who literally went on television and told the world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:33.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她觉得她的工作就是撒旦的屁眼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that she thought her job was Satan's asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:34.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:36.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我，呃，没开玩笑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是啊，真精彩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, that's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那你从那之后还翻身了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, and you came back from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.34,0:10:41.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，是啊，我翻身了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, I came back from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，现在这节目归我管。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I'm running the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:45.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能帮你翻身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can bring you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:47.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:50.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有什么计划？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，这个嘛，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.45,0:10:55.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有一屋子可爱的女士等着你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a house full of lovely ladies for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:56.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有机会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have the opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:10:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱上她们中的一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to fall in love with one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别太夸张了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's not get crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好吧，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, okay, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么立场？你不相信爱情吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where do you stand? Do you not believe in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.96,0:11:06.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是，我们……我们到底什么情况？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, where... what do we... Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，当你是达瑞斯·贝克时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, when you're Darius Beck,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.24,0:11:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}事情会有点复杂。明白了，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}things get a little complicated. Got it, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，首先，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:13.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们别用第三人称称呼自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}let's not refer to ourself in third person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不可爱。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not cute. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其次，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Second of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些女人都不知道男嘉宾是谁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}none of these women know who the suitor is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:20.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，她们都不是来钓什么名人的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, none of them are here to, like, bag some celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:22.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，你上次遇到这种事是什么时候？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When was the last time that happened to you, honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:24.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}初中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Junior high.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多谢夸奖。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，等她们知道新男嘉宾是谁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, when they realize who the new suitor is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都会变。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that'll all change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，只是，你永远说不准。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, just, you never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:32.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可能会惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You could be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.86,0:11:34.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bitch, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:35.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，得了吧，你少来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, bitch, please, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.96,0:11:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.53,0:11:40.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢我。来吧，走吧。好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You like me. Come on, let's go. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这儿有什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see what we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-瑞秋。  -她想说话……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rachel.   -She wants to speak...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:45.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没开玩笑，丹。瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not kidding, Dan. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:47.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}医生，她想……丹，你走开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doc, she wants to... Dan, go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到。我得谈谈“疗愈角”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that. I need to talk about the "Healing Nook."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我自己的拍摄区，用来录我的出镜片段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The what? My own set to film my on-air segments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.41,0:11:55.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦对，你靠勒索奎因换来的出镜片段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes, your on-air segments that you got by blackmailing Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我记得。换我可不扔这块石头，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember. Oh, I wouldn't be throwing that particular stone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要我的角落。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need my nook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，提交正式申请。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, put in a formal request.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便说一句，你妈打电话来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And not for nothing, your mother called.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她又跟杰瑞米聊过了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's been talking to Jeremy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她觉得你在经历性欲亢奋的躁狂发作。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She thinks you're having hyper-sexual manic episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没躁狂。我在改变世界。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not manic. I'm changing the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.00,0:12:14.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰瑞米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你打劫了奎因的衣橱？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Did you raid Quinn's wardrobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还在跟我妈联系。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're still talking to my mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:19.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:22.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}性欲亢奋的躁狂发作，认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hyper-sexual manic episode, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.18,0:12:24.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们是谷歌出来的还是编的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you guys Google that or make it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:26.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看起来你好几周没睡了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks like you haven't slept in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以呢？你担心我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so, what? You're worried about me?
