Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:25.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后他给她买个大钻戒……天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then gives them a big diamond ring... Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还发誓再也不会了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And promises to never do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？我是制作人，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know something? That I am the show runner, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.16,0:16:31.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在制作人在问你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And right now the show runner is asking you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么没能搞定鲁比。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why you weren't able to close Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:38.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我都没觉得自己有底线，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, even I didn't think I had line,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但结果，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but turns out,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:41.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毁掉一个坚强黑人女性的学业，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}derailing a strong black woman's education,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.83,0:16:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这。你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that's it. You know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光是有个黑人男嘉宾，我们就已经是巨大的宣言了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're making a huge statement just by having a black suitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以如果一路上得牺牲几个人，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So if we have to sacrifice a few people along the way
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了大局，那就这样吧。对，你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the greater good, so be it. Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.11,0:16:54.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就像阿兹特克人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're like Aztecs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.65,0:16:56.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者希特勒。她在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or Hitler. Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:13.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鲁比·卡特，对吧？鲁比？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ruby Carter, right? Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.60,0:17:14.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，我是蕾切尔·戈德堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, I'm Rachel Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是《永恒》的制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am the show runner on "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.57,0:17:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？我已经跟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Look, I already told
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.14,0:17:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个瘦小兄弟说过不行了，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the little skinny brother no, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.41,0:17:27.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.81,0:17:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他当时不知道全部信息。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but he just didn't have all the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:31.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么信息能\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What information is gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我退学，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}make me drop out of college
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去上一个种族主义、厌女的真人秀，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to go be on a racist, misogynist reality show
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.82,0:17:36.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我根本都不看？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每周1600万观众看你的政治主张，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}16 million viewers a week for your political platform
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.63,0:17:41.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}趁你的推特名气还没像坏牛奶一样过期。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when your Twitter fame's about to expire like bad milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:45.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}黑人女孩在那种节目里只撑得了两周，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Black girls only last a couple weeks on those shows,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:47.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且一点镜头都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and they don't get any airtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:49.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是说不看吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought you said you didn't watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.74,0:17:52.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随便吧。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，你就不在乎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, does it not even matter to you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这季在创造历史吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we're making history this season?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:57.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男嘉宾是黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The suitor's black.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-抱歉，什么？  -这是个大秘密。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm sorry, what?   -It's a huge secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那人还很有名，他要求见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The guy's also famous, and he asked to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:06.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他觉得你是美国英雄。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thinks you're an American hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.89,0:18:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且他对你有意思。他觉得……等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he's into you. He thinks... Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我把话说清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得我考上伯克利，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think I got myself into Berkeley,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为信仰这么拼命，就为了什么，找个男人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}worked this hard for what I believe in to, what, get a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去瓦萨可不是为了找男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't go to Vassar to get a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.26,0:18:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。你听我说话了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm sure. Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.73,0:18:21.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:22.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，你……你说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you are... You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该留在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就该让你那四个工资微薄的教授\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You should just let your four underpaid professors
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.44,0:18:26.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}读你的毕业论文，关于……什么来着？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}read your senior thesis on... What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.64,0:18:28.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后殖民时期的非洲？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Post-colonial Africa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.24,0:18:30.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂。你干嘛要用愚蠢的老电视\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get it. Why would you want to use stupid old TV
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来传播你的理念呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to spread your message.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:33.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，青少年生育率降了5.6%，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, the teen birth rate, it went down 5.6%
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就因为MTV的《少女妈妈》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because of "Teen Mom" shows on MTV.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.48,0:18:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有《真实世界》……你记得那节目吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And "The Real World"... You remember that show?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:40.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那节目开启了同性恋平权运动。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That show started the gay rights movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:44.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，对，电视作为变革媒介超级没用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, yeah, TV's super useless as a medium for change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:48.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证你能进最后两强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guarantee you will make it to the final two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.76,0:18:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}9周，每周1600万观众。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}9 weeks, 16 million viewers each week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:02.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，蕾切，怎么样？她加入了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rach, what's up? She's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:04.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看她能撑多久。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see how long she lasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.59,0:19:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方臭得要命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This place smells like ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:21.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊，最好是你拿着空气清新……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, that better be you with the air fresh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.53,0:19:23.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，小家伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你剩下的部分去哪了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did the rest of you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这就是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well, this is what happens
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.57,0:19:30.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你甩掉50磅的软弱、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you shed 50 pounds of weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}悲伤和窝囊之后的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sadness, and pussydom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:34.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜，我……我猜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations, I... I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.57,0:19:37.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你到底在这儿干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But what the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布拉德停了你片场的职。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Brad suspended you from set duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:42.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，布拉德已经不在电视台工作了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, uh, Brad doesn't work at the network anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:43.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.85,0:19:45.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加里要另请人了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gary's gonna hire somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:47.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我提了几个名字。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I threw out a couple names.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:49.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你消失六个月\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you just disappear for six months
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:50.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后害布拉德被开除？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then get Brad fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我没消失。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I didn't disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.66,0:19:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去参加了旧石器生活方式的静修\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I went on a paleolithic lifestyle retreat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.43,0:19:55.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我的大首领一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with my grand leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:58.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么？类似CrossFit之类的鬼东西？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what is that? Like CrossFit or some bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.30,0:20:00.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}CrossFit，真厉害。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}CrossFit. That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我跟我部落去巴塔哥尼亚打猎了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I went hunting in Patagonia with my tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.00,0:20:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就是这么进化的，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's how we evolved, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们住城市才四百年左右。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've only been in cities for like 400 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们当穴居人已经两万年了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We've been cavemen for like 20,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.97,0:20:10.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话没有一处是准确的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not even one part of that is accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:12.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男人不算男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A man isn't man
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:14.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非他有目标，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}unless he's got a purpose, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.68,0:20:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去年变得软弱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I got soft last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.38,0:20:20.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我试图填补我男子气概的空洞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tried to fill the dark hole of my manhood
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.05,0:20:23.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用精制面粉、糖、毒品。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with, uh, processed flour and sugar, drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:27.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还逼你扮演了男人的角色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I forced you to play the male role.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.59,0:20:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不公平，也不自然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That wasn't fair, and it wasn't natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:33.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}女人天生就是用来滋养、被崇拜的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Women are made to nurture, be adored.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.50,0:20:35.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男人得做事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A guy's got to do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，这节目是我的王国，也是我的目标。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, this show is my kingdom and, um, my purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:42.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要把它夺回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:46.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:47.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是我的。我挣来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's mine. I earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:49.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，但我准备好了，我是酋长。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but see, I'm ready, I'm a chieftain.
