Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我……让我去跟她说。我去说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let me... let me talk to her. I'll talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:25:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给露比安排车了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, um, did you get the car for Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.03,0:25:03.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}安排了，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.97,0:25:05.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她几分钟前到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She arrived a few minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.30,0:25:06.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正在安顿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just getting settled in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.81,0:25:08.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.71,0:25:14.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨，那个，贝丝·安想换房间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, so, uh, Beth Ann wants to switch rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.28,0:25:16.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蒂芙妮房间里有张空床，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Tiffany has an empty bed in her room,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:17.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我想把她安排过去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I was just gonna put her in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.98,0:25:19.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以吗？哦，等等，抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that okay? Oh, wait, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.28,0:25:21.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安，我们的白人至上主义者，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, Beth Ann, our white supremacist,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.89,0:25:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不想跟香塔尔同住，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}doesn't want to room with Chantal,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.16,0:25:25.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的黑人名媛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}our black debutante?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.89,0:25:27.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我就是想把她挪一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, uh, I was just gonna move her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.16,0:25:28.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}特别简单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It would be super easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.90,0:25:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，伯克·威廉姆斯这周是免费做脑叶切除吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, okay, was it free lobotomy week at Burke Williams?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.83,0:25:33.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊，我们不是夏令营辅导员。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, we aren't camp counselors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.97,0:25:35.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不解决问题，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't solve problems, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.90,0:25:37.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们制造问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We create them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.30,0:25:39.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后把镜头对准它们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then we point cameras at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.24,0:25:41.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们需要你出去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need you to go outside
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.64,0:25:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在镜头前制造一场争吵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and create an on-camera fight
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.08,0:25:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在那个种族主义者和黑人名媛之间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}between the racist and the black debutante.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.71,0:25:47.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.65,0:25:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}需要帮忙吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.65,0:25:52.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瓦格斯坦，这些女士有什么心理黑料？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wagerstein, what is the shrink dirt on these ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.32,0:25:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香塔尔是A型控制狂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well, Chantal is a type-A control freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:25:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像个随时会爆的定时炸弹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Kind of a time bomb waiting to go off.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.19,0:26:00.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，她未婚夫死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. Oh, and her fiancé died
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.69,0:26:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一年半前死于车祸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in a car accident a year and a half ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.33,0:26:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完美，太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, perfect. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.20,0:26:06.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就利用这一点信息，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so you're gonna use that little bit of information,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.03,0:26:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去采访她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're gonna interview her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:10.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要把她弄哭，让她在你面前掉眼泪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you're gonna get her to cry and show you tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.10,0:26:12.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会问你：'我还能再爱吗？'\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna ask you, "Will I ever love again?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.20,0:26:14.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样就能让大家都同情香塔尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna build all this sympathy for Chantal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.11,0:26:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}贝丝·安就会显得像个十足的混蛋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Beth Ann's gonna look like a total dick
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.88,0:26:17.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连跟她同住都不肯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for not wanting to room with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.24,0:26:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Does that make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.81,0:26:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我真的觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I just really don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.11,0:26:21.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不会想谈这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she's gonna want to talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.95,0:26:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我总不能逼她吧？我不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, how am I supposed to force her? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.02,0:26:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟她说你妈死了之类的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell her your mother died or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.82,0:26:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}装得你懂她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Act like you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.16,0:26:30.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我妈真的死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My mom did die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.82,0:26:33.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不就得了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.12,0:26:35.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这样，看到没？用上它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right there, you see that? You use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.73,0:26:40.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.27,0:26:49.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂亮，瑞秋。真是漂亮。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice, Rachel. That was really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.34,0:26:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样？这就是你的计划？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, that's it? That's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.91,0:26:54.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就打算让奎恩当好人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just gonna make Quinn look like the good cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.05,0:26:57.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我的计划是做一档收视冠军节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, my plan is to make a top-rated television program
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.18,0:26:58.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男主角是黑人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a black romantic lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.88,0:27:00.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有意见吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.05,0:27:04.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。好，很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do not. Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.72,0:27:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你能去把贝丝·安的采访弄来吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then can you go get Beth Ann's interview
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.16,0:27:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说她那几个黑人室友的坏话？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}talking trash about her black roommates?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.79,0:27:09.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为宣传片我手头没素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I don't have anything for the promo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.16,0:27:11.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了，拜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.87,0:27:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.87,0:27:17.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.74,0:27:23.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，我是不是忘了告诉你，当老板很糟心？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hm. Did I forget to tell you that being the boss sucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.28,0:27:29.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便说一句，夹克不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice jacket, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赫尔穆特·朗的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Helmut Lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.92,0:27:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来，敬酒和名牌衣服。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, here's to booze and fancy clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.23,0:27:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太激动人心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.37,0:27:48.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.77,0:27:51.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香塔尔，我很好奇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Chantal, I'm really curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.37,0:27:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是什么来头？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.24,0:27:56.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，她永远搞不定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh. My God, she's never gonna get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.14,0:27:57.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我出生在亚特兰大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I was born in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.81,0:28:00.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和我妈，还有……这是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Me and my mom and... What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.05,0:28:02.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都是没人关心的废话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's some general crap nobody cares about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.05,0:28:04.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你、你来这儿激动吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A-are you excited to be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.15,0:28:06.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我非常激动能来这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm very excited to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.25,0:28:07.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在浪费我时间。这样吧，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's wasting my time. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.99,0:28:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我干脆自己出去做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just gonna go out there and do this myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.19,0:28:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，停下。不，别停。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, stop. No, don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.99,0:28:12.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这太荒唐了。瑞秋，瑞秋，停下。好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is ridiculous. Rachel, Rachel, stop. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.39,0:28:14.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么可能学得会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How is she gonna ever learn anything
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.39,0:28:16.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你不放手教她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you don't delegate and teach her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.40,0:28:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我现在对你这样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Like what I'm doing with you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.36,0:28:20.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在搞砸，但我不会接手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're screwing up, and I'm not taking over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.87,0:28:22.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}暂时不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.40,0:28:25.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些监视器里的一切都归你管，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are in charge of everything on these monitors,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.40,0:28:27.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不只是弄哭一个女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not just getting one girl to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.44,0:28:30.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以去给那笨蛋传话，告诉她该怎么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So get in the idiot's ear and tell her what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.44,0:28:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.15,0:28:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他人很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.42,0:28:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得……好，麦迪逊，嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think... Okay, Madison, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.95,0:28:42.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你听清我说的每句话，然后跟着我重复。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to listen to everything I say and just repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.29,0:28:43.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.29,0:28:44.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。嗯，收到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Yeah, uh, copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.92,0:28:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉，我有时会这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, I just do that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.56,0:28:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我瞎说的，很蠢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... I talk, it's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.83,0:28:53.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，好，好。她怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, okay, okay. How's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.10,0:28:54.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麦迪逊，听我说就行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Madison, just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.83,0:28:57.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么说你就怎么说。别的什么都别说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just say what I say. Don't say anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.80,0:28:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“亚特兰大，在那儿约会是什么样？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"So, Atlanta, what was it like dating there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.57,0:29:02.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说那里……“亚特兰大，那儿约会怎么样？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hear it's..." So, Atlanta, what was the dating there like?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.34,0:29:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说很难。不，别自己填空。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard that it's really hard. No, don't fill in the blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.18,0:29:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要让她来说，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We want her to do that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.98,0:29:08.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？就像对句。我说一句。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you get it? It's like a couplet. I say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.51,0:29:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后她把句子剩下的说完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then she'll say the rest of the sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.05,0:29:11.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.58,0:29:13.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底想聊什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What was it you wanted to talk about exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.48,0:29:15.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，听着，麦迪逊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, listen, Madison.
