Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.16,0:29:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就问她，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just ask her,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.82,0:29:20.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“那你为什么还单身？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"So, why are you still single?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.39,0:29:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么还单身？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you still single?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.86,0:29:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.33,0:29:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么都别说，麦迪逊。闭上嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't say anything, Madison. Keep your mouth shut.
