Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.25,0:29:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“天啊，发生了什么？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Oh, my God, what happened?"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.35,0:29:51.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，发生了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. What happened?
