Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.72,0:38:14.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定你没还在嗑药？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure you're not still on drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.66,0:38:15.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。我从没这么清醒过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I've never been this clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.83,0:38:16.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我们俩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.93,0:38:18.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拼尽全力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I tried as a hard as I could
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.13,0:38:20.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想成为你想要的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to be everything you wanted me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.06,0:38:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果成了个被阉了的胖子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I ended up a castrated, obese mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.07,0:38:24.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢，成了个干巴巴的老处女。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ended up a dried-up old spinster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.07,0:38:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你到底想怎样，切特？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want, Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.41,0:38:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要女孩们来找达瑞斯……在这儿……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want the girls to come to Darius... here...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.51,0:38:34.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿比基尼，在池边喝鸡尾酒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in bikinis, pool-side cocktails.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.95,0:38:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会再损失三小时夜戏，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We would lose three more hours of hard night
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.75,0:38:38.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还得全组转场，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on a company move,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.42,0:38:40.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就只剩两小时拍摄了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that would leave us two hours to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.69,0:38:43.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.96,0:38:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在就把达瑞斯带到豪宅来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring Darius to the mansion right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.83,0:38:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就不要晚礼服了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I will ditch the evening gowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.60,0:38:52.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我给你泳池和比基尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I will give you a pool and the bikinis.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.63,0:38:55.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者我直接去告诉加里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or I could just go and tell Gary
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.60,0:38:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得推后几天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we're gonna push a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.64,0:38:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行，就按我说的在豪宅拍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, we'll do it my way at the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.77,0:39:01.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这远远没完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.44,0:39:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要拿回我的王国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm taking my kingdom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.71,0:39:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿强者胜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}May the best man win.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.71,0:39:08.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通常都是她赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She usually does.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.85,0:39:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切特刚宣战了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chet just declared war.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:23.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有问题吗，各位？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any issues, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.13,0:39:24.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, people,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.73,0:39:27.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们只有五小时夜戏时间拍完这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we've got five hours of hard night to get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.63,0:39:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}明白吗？谢谢。泳池边要架灯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay? Thank you. I need lights in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.87,0:39:31.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要所有女孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need all the girls
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.14,0:39:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脱掉礼服，换上比基尼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}out of their gowns and into bikinis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.74,0:39:35.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抹好油、喷完美黑，下面也刮干净了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oiled up, spray-tanned, and pube-less now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.67,0:39:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这他妈又是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.01,0:39:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，这个必须遮住。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you got to cover that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.68,0:39:40.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人妻选手不能有纹身。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wifeys have no tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.14,0:39:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这又是什么……这又是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what are you... What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.15,0:39:43.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行，除非你能编出个好故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, unless you have a great story
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.61,0:39:44.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说那底下是烧伤留下的疤，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about being a burn victim under there,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.02,0:39:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}否则你得换掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you're got to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.15,0:39:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就只有这件。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.75,0:39:49.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的假的？我来搞定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously? I will fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.92,0:39:52.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，马上把她的助理叫过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, get her P.A. over here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.19,0:39:54.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实在不行就让她穿别人的内衣，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put her in someone else's underwear if you have to
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.56,0:39:55.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我是内衣透视眼，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because I'm an underwear psychic,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.03,0:39:58.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打赌这女的带的全是大妈内裤，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I bet this bitch packed granny panties, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.16,0:40:00.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上把我们的外套拿来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me our coats now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:01.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快去，动作快点！外套。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go. Move it! Coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.20,0:40:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？去拿。借过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right? Get them. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.63,0:40:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瓦格斯坦。什么事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wagerstein. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.84,0:40:05.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也想穿比基尼？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to get in a bikini, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.10,0:40:07.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不想。出去，马上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Out. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.04,0:40:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-明白。  -谢谢，拜拜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Got it.   -Thank you. Buh-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.81,0:40:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有件衣服穿在她身上肯定超正，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got something that would look banging on her
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.51,0:40:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在我们房间。你是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}back in our room. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:13.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.68,0:40:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.05,0:40:18.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，别过去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.55,0:40:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是……那是性感瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's, uh... That's Hot Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.19,0:40:23.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太精彩了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.92,0:40:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能别这样吗？对，快走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you not? Yes, please go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.82,0:40:28.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跑啊，性感瑞秋，快跑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run, Hot Rachel, run.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.69,0:40:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外套，外套拿来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coats, I got coats.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.70,0:40:31.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.56,0:40:33.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她长得真像你。还挺神奇的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She really looks like you. That's kind of amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.73,0:40:35.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，都听我说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.20,0:40:39.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想看到谁刮出红印子，各位，懂吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to see any razor burn, people, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.67,0:40:43.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实在不行就用胶带，反正毛必须弄干净。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Use duct tape if you have to, but I want those pubes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.07,0:40:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩，我要是老这么跟着你转，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, if I keep following you around like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.98,0:40:46.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剧组会很难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the crew's gonna have a really hard time
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.54,0:40:47.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我是制作人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}believing I'm the show runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.68,0:40:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.78,0:40:50.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那切特抢走我们男嘉宾的时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, were you show-running
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.08,0:40:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个制作人在干嘛？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when you let Chet steal our suitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.95,0:40:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我当时在招揽露比，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I was recruiting Ruby,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.68,0:40:56.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你都没提醒我切特回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you didn't even warn me that Chet was back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.59,0:40:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当了老板就没人会提醒你任何事。我们不是说好的吗！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one warns you about anything when you're the boss. That's not our deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.76,0:41:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，听我说，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, listen to me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.03,0:41:05.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯，看着我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.16,0:41:06.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.26,0:41:07.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.60,0:41:10.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我需要切特彻底玩完。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I need Chet dead forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.70,0:41:11.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还有机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll get another shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.97,0:41:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只要带我们躲过这场灾难，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just got to steer us past this train wreck,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.87,0:41:16.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后就把节目交还给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then I will hand the show back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.57,0:41:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}金钱、男人、权力，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Money, dick, power, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.61,0:41:24.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。没错，金钱、男人、权力。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah, money, dick, power.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.85,0:41:26.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.08,0:41:27.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，开工吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.59,0:41:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连我也拦不住太阳升起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even I can't stop the sun from rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.99,0:41:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老天知道我试过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lord knows I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.81,0:41:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我们一路杀向天堂 *\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Oh, we kill our way to heaven *
